  "notes": "{崇|あが}める means to worship or idolize, implying deep reverence.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n\nREGISTER:\nFormal or literary. For casual contexts, use {大好|だいす}き or ファン.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {神|かみ}を{崇|あが}める: to worship a god\n- スターを{崇|あが}める: to idolize a star\n- {崇|あが}められる: to be worshipped/idolized\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {崇拝|すうはい}: worship, adoration (noun)\n- {尊|たっと}ぶ: to respect, to value\n- {敬|うやま}う: to respect, to honor",
